{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]呀！你们身上的魔法是……“那对姐妹的怨念”……！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":1,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾薇杜尔","text":"[show]那对姐妹的怨念？什么意思？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]那是很久很久以前的事了……当时黑森林里满是分裂的部落，这个魔法是由一对分属不同部落的姐妹所引发的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]她们原本是一对非常恩爱的姐妹，可后来部落间的冲突使她们产生了各种各样的误会，她们的关系在拷打般的折磨下破裂，直至反目成仇。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]后来在部落的冲突中，两姐妹双双殒命，但她们的争斗并未停止。两人成为灵魂后依旧互相敌视，两股怨气相冲至今，最终形成了这种古老魔法，附着在物品之上……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":1,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","scaleY":0.9},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]原来还发生过这样的事……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]那姐妹两人原本在同一个部落长大，但后来部落分裂，她们也就此被分到了不同的部落。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]不过两人的关系并没有变差，她们甚至长期保持见面。后来有歹人挑拨，让她们姐妹的关系急转直下。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾薇杜尔","text":"[show]让这对好姐妹反目成仇……这是怎么做到的？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]……就是两姐妹互相误会了对方。妹妹以为姐姐把她们部落的信息透露了出去，姐姐以为妹妹借着自己提供的信息袭击了己方猎队。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]在大潮般的纷争裹挟下，两姐妹连一次正常交谈、澄清误会的机会都没有。两人就这样带着仇恨与不解，消失在了战火的灰烬之中。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1e","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾薇杜尔","text":"[show]好可怜的姐妹……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1e","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]我大概知道了这个诅咒的来历。所以这个诅咒到底是什么效果，而我们应该怎么做才能消除它呢？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]效果……大概就是像你们现在这样，让你们的双手紧紧握在一起，永不分离。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]至于怎么消除……要么施展更强大的魔法强行破除，要么就去解开那两姐妹的仇怨，安抚她们的灵魂，这样魔法就会消失。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1f","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾薇杜尔","text":"[show]这……不说能不能找到这对姐妹，就算找到了，我们又该如何安抚她们的怨恨呢……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1f","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1c","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]但也不能强行用魔法破除。要是拿捏不准分寸……我们的手都得被炸烂。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]只能去找那两姐妹了……雅拉德小姐，你知道这两位姐妹在哪里吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]去悲怆之丘，潜入灵魂之流吧。两人的灵魂就徘徊在那里。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"雅拉德","text":"[show]不过这已经是很久以前的事了，我不确定她们是否还在。但如果你们想要找到她们的线索，就必须去那里一趟。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾薇杜尔","text":"[show]悲怆之丘……就是我经过试炼的地方吧。姐姐，这个我熟。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":-161,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-416,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-383.60000000000014,"scaleX":0.9,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara015_1","addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","scaleY":0.9},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]只能如此了……不过我们还得考虑一件事，就是要如何说服那对姐妹，光打赢她们可没法让魔法解除。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":250,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-383.600000